{"id":"652199","name":"茶叶蛋","author":"草莓","authorId":"19344","desc":"","cover":"images/652199/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"10个"}],"sub":[{"name":"花椒","amount":"5g"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"5g"},{"name":"茶叶","amount":"3g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所需鸡蛋和红烧酱油。","img":"images/652199/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把鸡蛋放入锅中煮8分钟。","img":"images/652199/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"拿一个碗里面加入5勺生抽。","img":"images/652199/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入3勺红烧酱油。","img":"images/652199/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入2勺盐。","img":"images/652199/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备好花椒，香叶和茶叶。","img":"images/652199/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"鸡蛋捞出来敲碎蛋壳。","img":"images/652199/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把花椒茶叶和香叶放入锅中。","img":"images/652199/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入调好的那碗酱汁。","img":"images/652199/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把鸡蛋放入锅中小火煮10分钟后关火再焖1小时。","img":"images/652199/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"茶叶蛋晾凉后放入冰箱可以吃几天。","img":"images/652199/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"鸡蛋煮熟后要把蛋壳敲碎，这样鸡蛋比较入味。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}